<main class="gg-page">
  <section class="gg-hero">
    <div class="gg-hero-copy">
      <p class="gg-kicker">Student-built goal tracking app</p>
      <h1>Grow the goals you keep coming back to.</h1>
      <p>
        Goal Grower turns habits and long-term goals into living plants.
        Water them with small actions, build shared gardens, and watch your
        consistency become something you can see.
      </p>

      <div class="gg-actions">
        <a href="/pages/contact#testing" class="gg-btn gg-btn-dark">Join beta testing</a>
        <a href="/pages/support" class="gg-btn gg-btn-light">Support the project</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="gg-hero-visual">
      <div class="gg-orbit-card gg-orbit-one">small steps count</div>
      <div class="gg-orbit-card gg-orbit-two">shared gardens beta</div>

      <div class="gg-phone-card">
        <div class="gg-phone-top">Today’s Garden</div>
        <div class="gg-plant-art"></div>
        <h3>Morning Stretch</h3>
        <p>Watered 4 days this week</p>
        <button>Water plant</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="gg-manifesto">
    <p class="gg-kicker">Why it exists</p>
    <h2>
      Most goal apps make you feel behind.
      <span>Goal Grower makes returning feel possible.</span>
    </h2>
  </section>

  <section class="gg-cards">
    <article class="gg-story-card dark">
      <span>01</span>
      <h3>Plant the goal</h3>
      <p>Create a habit or long-term goal and give it a place in your garden.</p>
    </article>

    <article class="gg-story-card green">
      <span>02</span>
      <h3>Water with action</h3>
      <p>Each small completion keeps the plant alive and growing.</p>
    </article>

    <article class="gg-story-card cream">
      <span>03</span>
      <h3>Return without shame</h3>
      <p>Missed days are not the end. The app is built around coming back.</p>
    </article>

    <article class="gg-story-card gold">
      <span>04</span>
      <h3>Grow together</h3>
      <p>Shared gardens help friends, family, and teams stay accountable.</p>
    </article>
  </section>

  <section class="gg-path-section">
    <div class="gg-section-heading">
      <p class="gg-kicker">How it works</p>
      <h2>A simple loop that feels alive.</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="gg-path">
      <div class="gg-path-line"></div>

      <div class="gg-path-step">
        <span>Seed</span>
        <h3>Choose something worth growing.</h3>
        <p>Start with one goal, habit, project, or promise to yourself.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="gg-path-step">
        <span>Water</span>
        <h3>Complete one small action.</h3>
        <p>Progress stays simple enough to do on real busy days.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="gg-path-step">
        <span>Garden</span>
        <h3>Watch consistency become visible.</h3>
        <p>Your plants show the work you have kept caring about.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="gg-path-step">
        <span>Together</span>
        <h3>Build shared gardens.</h3>
        <p>Grow alongside people who are working on their own goals too.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="testing" class="gg-beta">
    <div>
      <p class="gg-kicker">Beta testing</p>
      <h2>Help shape Goal Grower before launch.</h2>
      <p>
        Join the testing list for early access, app updates, and feedback
        requests from the student team building it.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="gg-email-card">
      {% form 'customer', class: 'gg-email-form' %}
        <input type="hidden" name="contact[tags]" value="Goal Grower Beta Tester">

        <label for="GoalGrowerEmail">Email for beta access</label>

        <div class="gg-email-row">
          <input
            id="GoalGrowerEmail"
            type="email"
            name="contact[email]"
            placeholder="you@example.com"
            required
          >
          <button type="submit">Join list</button>
        </div>

        {% if form.posted_successfully? %}
          <p class="gg-success">You are on the testing list. Thank you.</p>
        {% endif %}

        {% if form.errors %}
          <p class="gg-error">Please check your email and try again.</p>
        {% endif %}
      {% endform %}

      <p class="gg-small">No spam. Just testing links, launch updates, and build notes.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="gg-team-strip">
    <div>
      <p class="gg-kicker">Built by three college students</p>
      <h2>Not a giant company. A small team building in public.</h2>
      <p>
        Goal Grower is being designed, coded, tested, and improved by students
        learning how to turn a real idea into a real product.
      </p>
    </div>

    <a href="/pages/about-goal-grower" class="gg-btn gg-btn-light">Meet the team</a>
  </section>

  <section class="gg-support">
    <div>
      <p class="gg-kicker">Fund the project</p>
      <h2>Support the next version.</h2>
      <p>
        Support helps cover app store costs, testing, design work, development
        tools, and the features that make Goal Grower better.
      </p>
      <a href="/pages/support" class="gg-btn gg-btn-light">Support development</a>
    </div>

    <div class="gg-support-list">
      <div><span>01</span><p>Beta testing and publishing costs</p></div>
      <div><span>02</span><p>Shared gardens and reminder improvements</p></div>
      <div><span>03</span><p>Better onboarding and app tutorials</p></div>
      <div><span>04</span><p>Keeping a student-built project alive</p></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="gg-store-preview">
    <div class="gg-section-heading">
      <p class="gg-kicker">Store</p>
      <h2>Useful products that help fund the app.</h2>
      <p>
        Goal Grower merch, journals, desk tools, tech accessories, and simple
        products for people building better days.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="gg-store-grid">
      <a href="/collections/goal-grower" class="gg-store-card">
        <div class="gg-product-art"></div>
        <span>Merch</span>
        <h3>Goal Grower apparel</h3>
        <p>Simple merch connected to the app and mission.</p>
      </a>

      <a href="/collections/stationery" class="gg-store-card">
        <div class="gg-product-art"></div>
        <span>Desk</span>
        <h3>Journals and planners</h3>
        <p>Offline tools for ideas, habits, and planning.</p>
      </a>

      <a href="/collections/tech" class="gg-store-card">
        <div class="gg-product-art"></div>
        <span>Tech</span>
        <h3>Focus accessories</h3>
        <p>Small products for calmer routines.</p>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="gg-feedback">
    <div>
      <p class="gg-kicker">Feedback</p>
      <h2>Tell us what would make this better.</h2>
      <p>
        Found a confusing screen? Have a feature idea? Want to help test?
        Send feedback directly to the team.
      </p>
    </div>

    <a href="/pages/contact" class="gg-btn gg-btn-dark">Contact us</a>
  </section>

  <section class="gg-faq">
    <div class="gg-section-heading">
      <p class="gg-kicker">FAQ</p>
      <h2>Questions before you join.</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="gg-faq-list">
      <details>
        <summary>Is Goal Grower available yet?</summary>
        <p>Goal Grower is currently in development and beta testing.</p>
      </details>

      <details>
        <summary>Who is building it?</summary>
        <p>Goal Grower is being built by three college students through Ziyu Development.</p>
      </details>

      <details>
        <summary>Can I use it for big goals?</summary>
        <p>Yes. It is designed for both daily habits and long-term goals.</p>
      </details>

      <details>
        <summary>Do store purchases support the app?</summary>
        <p>Yes. Store purchases help fund development after product and platform costs.</p>
      </details>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="gg-final">
    <h2>Start with one small seed.</h2>
    <p>Join the testing list and help shape Goal Grower before launch.</p>
    <a href="/pages/contact#testing" class="gg-btn gg-btn-dark">Join beta testing</a>
  </section>
</main>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Goal Grower Home",
  "settings": [],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "Goal Grower Home"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}